1/uploads/origins/f56095c2-16d6-470e-9756-21de4c6b5aeb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=29036cc485eb6cc0d44bb0df5df7701b 3x"}, "body": "I was attracted by the wonderful look of Uro's work and contacted him to make a commission.\n\nDetails of the request\nWe would like to ask you to create an illustration of Vtuber Noa Polaris (@noa_polaris).\n\nReference Diagram\nI will put the URL of the reference figure in the document URL.\nPlease use the figure with long hair and slanted bangs in the upper left as a base. (The upper right is the old model.)\nThe color of her eyes, the star-shaped highlights, the gradation of her hair color, the moon-flower in her hair ornament, and the earring of Ursa Minor in her left ear are the main points of this model.\n\nComposition.\nThe subject is enjoying a drink (a blue cocktail) at a bar counter.\nShe is wearing a white one-piece dress.\n\n[Scope of use, etc.\nWe would like to present the drawing to Ms. Noah herself and ask for permission to use it only for her.\nWe would also like to ask for your permission for use on social networking sites, Youtube (including membership-only distribution and distribution of membership benefits), video production, and other Vtuber activities. We would also like to ask for your permission to use the video on social networking sites, on Youtube (including membership-only distribution and distribution of membership privileges), and for video production and other Vtuber activities.\nIf there is a background or text, we would appreciate it if you could deliver it in layers on a psd or in multiple files.\nIt would be greatly appreciated if you could make it so that the hair and wings are not visible when creating thumbnails, etc.\n(We would like the size of the image to be 1920x1080px so that it can be used in the thumbnail or video, but if this is difficult, you can ignore it).\n\nIf this is too difficult, please feel free to cancel.\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/noa_polaris823/status/1655212550475382784", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@urochocco/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2660914, "client_id": 2324807, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a3baeec1/uploads/origins/0f744d69-651a-4d4a-b3a9-e0940cd77be1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a61d686323f88d79247e60cb5cb3162d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a3baeec1/uploads/origins/0f744d69-651a-4d4a-b3a9-e0940cd77be1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a61d686323f88d79247e60cb5cb3162d, https://si.imgix.net/a3baeec1/uploads/origins/0f744d69-651a-4d4a-b3a9-e0940cd77be1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac2ea28318af111a15ed5d5d4c44dae8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a3baeec1/uploads/origins/0f744d69-651a-4d4a-b3a9-e0940cd77be1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6bce295acfb9102e27e8486f8f816f2 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a3baeec1/uploads/origins/0f744d69-651a-4d4a-b3a9-e0940cd77be1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4d49e28faa881cffc70e46b907e90d41", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a3baeec1/uploads/origins/0f744d69-651a-4d4a-b3a9-e0940cd77be1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4d49e28faa881cffc70e46b907e90d41, https://si.imgix.net/a3baeec1/uploads/origins/0f744d69-651a-4d4a-b3a9-e0940cd77be1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fff894f39f07eefb4c0ea7e0478cbedc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a3baeec1/uploads/origins/0f744d69-651a-4d4a-b3a9-e0940cd77be1?bg=%23fff&auto=form