olors and eyes.\nI would like to request an illustration from Uro-sama.\n\nI would like to ask you to use the illustration you have created.\n→Thumbnails on YouTube\n→Use in video clips\n→Announcement on Twitter\n\nWe will leave the size, etc. up to you.\n\nIf you don't mind, it would be greatly appreciated if you could provide us with a transparent background file,\nor PSD files separated by layers would be greatly appreciated.\n\nPlease refer to the attached URL for the materials.\nWe do not have any particular requirements for costumes.\nYou may arrange the costumes as you wish.\nWe would appreciate it if you could write freely.\n\nThat is all.\nThank you for reading this request.\nWe hope you will consider our request.\nThank you very much.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/HOUSOUnoRIKKO1/status/1652244350057992192?t=0pI3Jf8BuX3L8eST-1P2UQ&s=19", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@urochocco/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2660914, "client_id": 2464604, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ddcbe120/uploads/origins/978b881e-09fd-410a-8c0b-1bb9e3d1bf74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=00ec23e00d4e7f6d75590d526ce2b2e7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ddcbe120/uploads/origins/978b881e-09fd-410a-8c0b-1bb9e3d1bf74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=00ec23e00d4e7f6d75590d526ce2b2e7, https://si.imgix.net/ddcbe120/uploads/origins/978b881e-09fd-410a-8c0b-1bb9e3d1bf74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ab631dfc5cf2e3c90b166576ebeaa7b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ddcbe120/uploads/origins/978b881e-09fd-410a-8c0b-1bb9e3d1bf74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e11ff4d815dd25ea1085d6d95491dd2 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": fal